        <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa3D/derived_variables/e_i>,
        <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa3D/derived_variables/f_i>,
        <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa3D/derived_variables/h_i>,
